@[expose] public section

/-!
# SVC cells: the SIGCHECK priority cells (Job SVCCELLS)

Each `cell_<FA>_<FB>_<sig>` (signature letters p, m, z for +, -, 0 for facets F0..F8 of `s0x_S24`)
is an instance of `SVC.single_view_closure`: the facings at the view are hypotheses, the tilts
come from `hR_two`, the signed dependency from `dep_of_chain` (a Bool-checked chain of facet
relations), and the order check is one `decide +kernel`. Generated by `cellgen.exe`.
-/

